Hi Team,

Just an update regarding the R34 build deployment.

We have not created the R33 tag yet. Although the Jiras are ready, the pseudo branch has not yet been merged into the master branch, which is causing a delay in the R34 build deployment.

The reason for waiting for the merge is to avoid the issue we encountered in the previous release. At that time, deploying directly from the pseudo branch to UAT resulted in the latest changes from the master branch being missed, which caused confusion and led to pseudo-related defects being raised.

To avoid a repeat of that situation, we will first merge the pseudo branch into the master branch, create the R33 tag, and then proceed with the R34 build deployment.

Thank you for your understanding.